    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our other games</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Hanna\u2019s only passion is music, but her parents are completely against such a frivolous hobby. One day, Hanna escapes from her problems into the world of her fantasies, where she can do anything!</strong><br><br>Go through obstacles, find Hanna's friends and perform with them at a music competition, but be careful \u2013 the unresolved problems will haunt you even in the brightest parts of your dreams...<br><br><br><strong>Solve the puzzle</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/b66f6045d21fe0bfaf68bc2ccb6c02aa.poster.avif?t=1735287856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/b66f6045d21fe0bfaf68bc2ccb6c02aa.webm?t=1735287856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/b66f6045d21fe0bfaf68bc2ccb6c02aa.mp4?t=1735287856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Skate on the ceiling and tilt the world</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/8c74de46197d2effd442b60875c2f203.poster.avif?t=1735287856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/8c74de46197d2effd442b60875c2f203.webm?t=1735287856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612000/extras/8c74de46197d2effd442b60875c2f203.mp4?t=1735287856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Enjoy colorful locations and collect secret achievements</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin